  "abstract_summary": "Autonomous water-cleaning vessels rely on accurate real-time perception of floating debris, yet detection in complex water-surface environments remains difficult due to small target size, scale variation, water-surface reflection, and illumination interference. We present CEC-YOLO, a lightweight detection algorithm...",
